{"text":{"en":{"원통 롤러 베어링 (복렬) | [회사명] 베어링":"Double Row Cylindrical Roller Bearings | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Double Row Cylindrical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>원통 롤러 베어링 (복렬)</h2> <p>단열 원통 롤러 베어링보다 궤도륜을 얇게 설계해 동일 외경에서 더 큰 부하능력을 낼 수 있는 복렬 구조입니다.</p> <p>압연기계의 롤, 공작기계 주축 등 고강성·고정밀 회전부에 사용됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Double Row Cylindrical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>Double Row Cylindrical Roller Bearings</h2> <p>Compared to single row cylindrical roller bearings, this double row design uses thinner raceway rings, achieving greater load capacity within the same outer diameter.</p> <p>Used in high-rigidity, high-precision rotating parts such as rolling mill rolls and machine tool spindles.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/double_row_cylindrical.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS Catalog Standard Drawing</p> <img src=\"img/double_row_cylindrical.png\" alt=\"Structural Cross-Section Diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d (bore) · D (outer diameter) · Tolerance (d/D) · B (width)</p>","<label for=\"drcFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"drcFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: NN3010 또는 50*80\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"drcFilter\">Search by Model / Spec</label> <input id=\"drcFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. NN3010 or 50*80\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"drcCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"drcToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"drcCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"drcToggleAll\">Expand All</button>","NN 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">80건</span>":"NN Series<span class=\"series-count\">80 items</span>","NNU 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">38건</span>":"NNU Series<span class=\"series-count\">38 items</span>","형번 / 규격 검색":"Search by Model / Spec","전체 펼치기":"Expand All"},"ja":{"원통 롤러 베어링 (복렬) | [회사명] 베어링":"円筒ころ軸受(複列) | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Double Row Cylindrical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>원통 롤러 베어링 (복렬)</h2> <p>단열 원통 롤러 베어링보다 궤도륜을 얇게 설계해 동일 외경에서 더 큰 부하능력을 낼 수 있는 복렬 구조입니다.</p> <p>압연기계의 롤, 공작기계 주축 등 고강성·고정밀 회전부에 사용됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Double Row Cylindrical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>円筒ころ軸受(複列)</h2> <p>単列円筒ころ軸受より軌道輪を薄く設計することで、同じ外径でもより大きな負荷能力を発揮できる複列構造です。</p> <p>圧延機のロール、工作機械の主軸など、高剛性・高精度の回転部に使用されます。</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">型番または寸法の一部を入力するだけで検索できます。</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/double_row_cylindrical.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">当社SWSカタログ規格図面</p> <img src=\"img/double_row_cylindrical.png\" alt=\"構造断面図\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(内径)・D(外径)・公差(d/D)・B(幅)</p>","<label for=\"drcFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"drcFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: NN3010 또는 50*80\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"drcFilter\">型番 / 規格検索</label> <input id=\"drcFilter\" type=\"text\